## Story Description
Edit src/models/database.py to add SQLAlchemy Core table definitions for ingestion_batches and transactions_raw, add source_raw_id to transactions_table, and add four helper functions: create_batch(), insert_raw_transactions() with deduplication, get_queued_raw_rows(), and mark_raw_rows_processed(). All new tables are added to the shared metadata object so they are created in SQLite for local dev and tests.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: src/models/database.py
- Add to metadata: ingestion_batches_table with columns id (Text PK), engagement_id (Text), filename (Text), row_count (Integer), new_rows (Integer), duplicate_rows (Integer), status (Text), uploaded_at (Text), completed_at (Text)
- Add to metadata: transactions_raw_table with columns id (Text PK), engagement_id (Text), batch_id (Text), source_row_hash (Text), pipeline_status (Text), invoice_number (Text), invoice_date (Text), raw_supplier_name (Text), base_amount (Float), raw_data (Text), created_at (Text)
