## Story Description
Edit backend/app/routers/ingestion.py to replace the monolithic _run_pipeline() function with the two-stage incremental flow: stage 1 writes to transactions_raw via Ingestor.ingest_to_raw(), stage 2 promotes queued rows via IncrementalPromoter.promote(). Remove the full-engagement re-harmonisation and re-categorisation. Add batch_id to the pipeline_jobs table link and return it in the /run response.

